Nl8ZDA","review_id":"iBcKRHmmlDJ_9XwLllE8EQ","date":"2020-01-08T15:26:10","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.943774938583374,"text_excerpt":"I am so excited that Acropolis opened up on Freret! We were lucky enough to snag a parking spot right at the front door which always makes me happy, and our entire visit followed suit. We were warmly welcomed by an employee working behind the gorgeous, huge bar area. Y'all, this place is so cool. It's huge, open, and I love that the chairs are mismatched at each table. The artwork and paint colors of the space remind me so much of my long ago visit to Greece. (Santorini) On this visit my husband ordered the pork slouvaki wrap and I had a gyro wrap. We both chose the grilled veggies as our sides, then when our food arrived we halved the wraps so we had one of each. Both wraps were deliciou..."},{"business_id":"Wh35Mk7kp6gnF-d_Nl8ZDA","review_id":"rzwkqw746OZw0EYClPhbGQ","date":"2020-01-28T21:08:40","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9392476677894592,"text_excerpt":"I haven't been to original Acropolis in Metairie in years, so I was really pleased to see that they were opening another location in the old Wayfare spot. I went over with my uncle for dinner last week and he reminisced about going to the original in Metairie when in first opened. I opted for a four course special for $20.95 and it was a great deal for the amount of food. I had cauliflower bisque to start then a Caesar salad and then grilled pompano and finally baklava for dessert. The soup was rich and delicious. The Caesar was fine and the grilled pompano was delicious plus I had pilaf and veg of the day to take home. My uncle and I split the baklava which was good. He had lamb kebabs b..."},{"business_id":"Wh35Mk7kp6gnF-d_Nl8ZDA","review_id":"SDzB_zlv_73qx5S8PM0IBA","date":"2020-01-11T05:18:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9312292337417603,"text_excerpt":"First time here and have to tell you, love this place. The ambiance, the service, the drinks and the food. Great specials by the way. The sweet potato soup with blue cheese crumbles is amazing. Service is great thanks to Patricia. We attentive, considerate and overall great. My new goto joint for Greek cuisine..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Wh35Mk7kp6gnF-d_Nl8ZDA","photo_id":"RalXDysiN_Jxyy7YduSi3Q","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/RalXDysiN_Jxyy7YduSi3Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8684881925582886},{"business_id":"Wh35Mk7kp6gnF-d_Nl8ZDA","photo_id":"gdaqbNyFq1QjleblWK5cyQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/gdaqbNyFq1QjleblWK5cyQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8684881329536438}]},"notebook_case":null}
